    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haydee III</strong> is the long-awaited sequel in the Haydee series, which will connect the story of the first and second games. As before, it features a heroine trapped in a facility filled with secrets, traps, and foes. Six new themed zones will immerse you in a profound sense of being lost, doomed, and desperate. Draw your pistols and screwdrivers, and clear your pockets out of junk. A new challenge awaits!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can expect:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast, intricate facility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lethal traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited inventory space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lack of resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail after fail</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The thrill of triumph</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And also mods, an editor, and the ability to climb on crates. Good luck!</p>",
